{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 COLLECTION — THE MEASURE (collection WINNING-SPEC §4.5, "elmsnest-v2-coll-ledger").

  Purpose, in one sentence: answer "I have a six-metre pergola" with ONE row that names every lamp the
  collection sells at that measure and what each one costs. It is the ruler's table of record — the same
  instrument seen twice — and it is the screen the ruler's rows link back into.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ where every number comes from
  NOTHING here is typed (§4.5 non-negotiable 1, §6.19). Every measure, every price and every per-unit
  figure is read out of snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-axis.liquid, which reads them out of
  product.options_with_values[0] and variant.price. The counts in the copy come from Liquid too
  (collection.products_count, the number of measured products, the number of rows). The one-page
  sentence is printed by snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-paginate.liquid so its wording lives in one file.

  This section does NO price arithmetic. Prices arrive as strings already rounded to the agora
  (plumbing CONTRACT risk 14); only price_cents is ever used, and only as a sort key.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ which collection gets a table
  One template serves all five URLs (§5.1), so the choice is made from the data, never from a handle:

    enabled off                         -> nothing at all is printed, not even the wrapper
    no products                         -> nothing
    fewer than two distinct measures    -> nothing (a one-row table is not a table)
    show_on = auto, and the dominant measured unit does not cover MORE THAN HALF the collection
                                        -> nothing

  That last test is the honest one, and it resolves exactly to §5.1 and §3.8.5:
    decor  4 of 7 products measured in metres      -> a 14-row metre table
    path   5 of 8 products measured in quantity    -> a 6-row quantity table
    wall   0 of 6                                  -> nothing
    spot   1 of 6 in quantity, 1 in LED            -> nothing
    all    6 of 27 in quantity                     -> nothing, which is §3.8.5's "no metre ledger on /all"
  Set show_on to «always» to print the table wherever two measures exist.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ area is not a length
  §4.5 non-negotiable 3. decorative-led-net-lights carries unit 'area', measured '0' and a min/max that
  are the FIRST DIMENSION ONLY. This file branches on meta[9] (measured) and never on min/max being
  non-empty, so the net can never take a metre row. It is named in the foot instead, with its real
  span read off its own option values — which is §4.5 non-negotiable 2: a product measured in another
  unit is NAMED, never hidden, and never given a row.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ how the rows are built
  ONE pass over collection.products asks the parser once per product and prints two flat models
  (a snippet's own assigns never reach its caller — CONTRACT risk 1 — so every model here is printed
  and split back):
    env2_rows   one record per (product, option value) that carries a number, keyed
                «<number*1000 + 1e8>~<price in agorot + 1e8>» so a plain string sort is a numeric sort,
                first by measure and then by price, which is the order §4.5's table prints.
    env2_infos  one record per product, so the foot can name the ones that have no row without asking
                the parser a second time.
  The dominant unit is the one the most products are measured in, ties resolved m > qty > led > w > k.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------ no JS, reduced motion
  There is NO behaviour to lose. Every measure, name, price and per-unit figure is markup; the table
  reads and buys with scripting disabled, because every product name is a plain link to its product
  page and the prices are printed, not fetched. §3.3 gives this section NO animation at all — it is a
  table and it should read like one — so prefers-reduced-motion removes only the link colour fades.

  The one enhancement is the row link. Its href is «#env2-coll-ruler», a real element that really
  scrolls, so the link works with scripting off; with scripting on the section also checks the ruler's
  radio for that stop and writes the ruler's own «#len-10» / «#qty-4» hash, which is §4.5's
  "every row is a link to the ruler at that stop". Stop keys use the CONTRACT risk 12 transform —
  the number with '.' replaced by '_' — because «#env2-stop-6.5» reads to a CSS parser as the id
  «env2-stop-6» plus the class «5». Decor's axis really does carry 1.5, 6.5 and 9.5.

  No image, no card and no glyph plate is rendered here, so this section needs no sprite (CONTRACT
  risk 11) and cannot spend one of §3.1's two scrim surfaces (risk 10). It carries no .env2-btn, so
  core REPORT §9.1's ink-on-glow anchor cannot appear (risk 9); the link colours are set from
  «.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__…» at (0,2,0), which outranks «.env2-section a» at (0,1,1).

  Shopify lexer note (2026-09-03, integration): Ruby Liquid closes an output tag at the FIRST «}»
  (VariableIncompleteEnd = /\}\}?/), so a «{n}» placeholder inside «{{ … }}» is a parse error on
  Shopify even though the offline python-liquid harness accepts it. Every placeholder substitution
  below is therefore done in an «assign» tag and only the finished string is echoed.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign FS = '~~F~~'
  assign RS = '~~R~~'
  assign env2_s = section.settings
  assign env2_c = collection
  assign env2_count = env2_c.products_count | default: 0
  assign env2_on = true
  if env2_s.enabled == false
    assign env2_on = false
  endif
  if env2_count == 0
    assign env2_on = false
  endif
  assign env2_short = true
  if env2_s.short_titles == false
    assign env2_short = false
  endif
  assign env2_fw = 'אחת,שתיים,שלוש,ארבע,חמש,שש,שבע,שמונה,תשע,עשר,אחת־עשרה,שתים־עשרה,שלוש־עשרה,ארבע־עשרה,חמש־עשרה,שש־עשרה,שבע־עשרה,שמונה־עשרה,תשע־עשרה,עשרים' | split: ','
  assign env2_perword = env2_s.per_unit_word | default: ''
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  PASS 1 — one render of the parser per product, and the two printed models. Fields are plain strings.

  env2_rows record:
    0 sort key «<measure key>~<price key>»  1 unit  2 number  3 unit_label  4 name  5 url
    6 number2  7 unit2_label  8 price  9 per_unit  10 per_unit_label  11 value (trimmed at « / »)
    12 available  13 terminator
  env2_infos record:
    0 unit  1 measured  2 is_area  3 how many option values  4 name  5 axis name  6 first value
    7 the value at the largest number  8 the last value  9 min  10 max  11 unit_label  12 unit_word
    13 url  14 terminator
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_rows = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_infos = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_n_m = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_q = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_l = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_w = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_k = 0 -%}
{%- if env2_on -%}
  {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
    {%- capture env2_ax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p, per_unit_word: env2_perword -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign env2_recs = env2_ax | split: RS -%}
    {%- if env2_recs.size > 1 -%}
      {%- assign env2_m = env2_recs[0] | split: FS -%}
      {%- assign env2_u = env2_m[3] -%}
      {%- assign env2_meas = env2_m[9] -%}
      {%- if env2_meas == '1' -%}
        {%- case env2_u -%}
          {%- when 'm' -%}{%- assign env2_n_m = env2_n_m | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- when 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_n_q = env2_n_q | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- when 'led' -%}{%- assign env2_n_l = env2_n_l | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- when 'w' -%}{%- assign env2_n_w = env2_n_w | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- when 'k' -%}{%- assign env2_n_k = env2_n_k | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- assign env2_nm = env2_p.title | default: '' -%}
      {%- if env2_short -%}
        {%- assign env2_nm = env2_nm | split: ' – ' | first -%}
        {%- assign env2_nm = env2_nm | split: ' — ' | first -%}
        {%- assign env2_nm = env2_nm | split: ' | ' | first -%}
        {%- assign env2_nm = env2_nm | split: ' - ' | first -%}
        {%- assign env2_nm = env2_nm | strip -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- assign env2_maxn = 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_maxv = '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_firstv = '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_lastv = '' -%}
      {%- for env2_rec in env2_recs offset: 1 -%}
        {%- assign s = env2_rec | split: FS -%}
        {%- assign env2_v = s[2] | split: ' / ' | first | strip -%}
        {%- if forloop.first -%}{%- assign env2_firstv = env2_v -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign env2_lastv = env2_v -%}
        {%- if s[3] != '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_nn = s[3] | times: 1000 | round -%}
          {%- if env2_nn > env2_maxn -%}
            {%- assign env2_maxn = env2_nn -%}
            {%- assign env2_maxv = env2_v -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_meas == '1' and s[3] != '' and s[4] == env2_u -%}
          {%- assign env2_k1 = s[3] | times: 1000 | round | plus: 100000000 -%}
          {%- assign env2_k2 = s[11] | plus: 100000000 -%}
          {%- capture env2_row -%}{{ env2_k1 }}~{{ env2_k2 }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_u }}{{ FS }}{{ s[3] }}{{ FS }}{{ s[5] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_nm }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_p.url }}{{ FS }}{{ s[7] }}{{ FS }}{{ s[9] }}{{ FS }}{{ s[10] }}{{ FS }}{{ s[13] }}{{ FS }}{{ s[14] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_v }}{{ FS }}{{ s[15] }}{{ FS }}e{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_rows = env2_rows | append: RS | append: env2_row -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

      {%- capture env2_info -%}{{ env2_u }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_meas }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[10] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[7] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_nm }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[2] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_firstv }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_maxv }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_lastv }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[11] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[12] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[4] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[5] }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_p.url }}{{ FS }}{{ env2_m[8] }}{{ FS }}e{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign env2_infos = env2_infos | append: RS | append: env2_info -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The dominant unit: the one the most products are measured in. Ties are resolved in a fixed order
  m > qty > led > w > k with a strict «greater than», so the answer never depends on iteration order.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_unit = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_unum = 0 -%}
{%- if env2_n_m > env2_unum -%}{%- assign env2_unit = 'm' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_m -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_n_q > env2_unum -%}{%- assign env2_unit = 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_q -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_n_l > env2_unum -%}{%- assign env2_unit = 'led' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_l -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_n_w > env2_unum -%}{%- assign env2_unit = 'w' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_w -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_n_k > env2_unum -%}{%- assign env2_unit = 'k' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_k -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_s.unit_mode != blank and env2_s.unit_mode != 'auto' -%}
  {%- assign env2_unit = env2_s.unit_mode -%}
  {%- assign env2_unum = 0 -%}
  {%- case env2_unit -%}
    {%- when 'm' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_m -%}
    {%- when 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_q -%}
    {%- when 'led' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_l -%}
    {%- when 'w' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_w -%}
    {%- when 'k' -%}{%- assign env2_unum = env2_n_k -%}
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The ordered, distinct measures of the dominant unit. The records are sorted as strings on the
  zero-padded key, so equal measures are adjacent and the cheaper offering of a shared measure comes
  first — which is the order §4.5's decor table prints 5, 12 and 22.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_sorted = env2_rows | remove_first: RS | split: RS | sort -%}
{%- assign env2_nums = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_prev = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_offers = 0 -%}
{%- for env2_r in env2_sorted -%}
  {%- assign f = env2_r | split: FS -%}
  {%- if f[1] == env2_unit -%}
    {%- assign env2_offers = env2_offers | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- unless f[2] == env2_prev -%}
      {%- assign env2_nums = env2_nums | append: ',' | append: f[2] -%}
      {%- assign env2_prev = f[2] -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign env2_numlist = env2_nums | remove_first: ',' | split: ',' -%}

{%- assign env2_show = false -%}
{%- if env2_on and env2_unit != '' and env2_numlist.size > 1 -%}
  {%- assign env2_show = true -%}
  {%- unless env2_s.show_on == 'always' -%}
    {%- assign env2_half = env2_unum | times: 2 -%}
    {%- unless env2_half > env2_count -%}
      {%- assign env2_show = false -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if env2_show -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_unit_label = ''
  assign env2_unit_word = ''
  for env2_r in env2_sorted
    assign f = env2_r | split: FS
    if f[1] == env2_unit and env2_unit_label == ''
      assign env2_unit_label = f[3]
    endif
  endfor
  assign env2_rowsn = env2_numlist.size
  assign env2_nword = ''
  if env2_unum > 0 and env2_unum <= env2_fw.size
    assign env2_wi = env2_unum | minus: 1
    assign env2_nword = env2_fw[env2_wi]
  else
    capture env2_nword
      echo '<bdi>'
      echo env2_unum
      echo '</bdi>'
    endcapture
  endif
  assign env2_offn = env2_count | minus: env2_unum
  assign env2_offword = ''
  if env2_offn > 0 and env2_offn <= env2_fw.size
    assign env2_wj = env2_offn | minus: 1
    assign env2_offword = env2_fw[env2_wj]
  else
    capture env2_offword
      echo '<bdi>'
      echo env2_offn
      echo '</bdi>'
    endcapture
  endif
  assign env2_perbool = false
  assign env2_permode = env2_s.show_unit_price | default: 'auto'
  if env2_permode == 'always'
    assign env2_perbool = true
  elsif env2_permode == 'auto' and env2_unit == 'qty'
    assign env2_perbool = true
  endif
  assign env2_linkrows = true
  if env2_s.link_rows == false
    assign env2_linkrows = false
  endif
  assign env2_h2 = env2_s.heading | default: 'כמה מטר צריך?'
  unless env2_unit == 'm'
    assign env2_h2 = env2_s.heading_alt | default: 'כמה מנורות צריך?'
  endunless
  assign env2_deck = env2_s.deck
  unless env2_unit == 'm'
    assign env2_deck = env2_s.deck_alt
  endunless
-%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_unit_word_src = ''
  assign env2_infolist = env2_infos | remove_first: RS | split: RS
  for env2_r in env2_infolist
    assign g = env2_r | split: FS
    if g[0] == env2_unit and env2_unit_word_src == ''
      assign env2_unit_word_src = g[12]
    endif
  endfor
  assign env2_unit_word = env2_unit_word_src
  capture env2_b_n
    echo '<bdi>'
    echo env2_unum
    echo '</bdi>'
  endcapture
  capture env2_b_rows
    echo '<bdi>'
    echo env2_rowsn
    echo '</bdi>'
  endcapture
  capture env2_b_count
    echo '<bdi>'
    echo env2_count
    echo '</bdi>'
  endcapture
  assign env2_deck = env2_deck | escape | replace: '{n_word}', env2_nword | replace: '{n}', env2_b_n | replace: '{rows}', env2_b_rows | replace: '{count}', env2_b_count | replace: '{unit_word}', env2_unit_word
-%}

<section id="env2-coll-ledger" data-env2-coll-ledger class="env2-section env2-coll env2-coll-ledger" dir="rtl" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;--env2-stars:.48" aria-labelledby="env2-coll-ledger-h2">
  <div class="env2-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-ledger__wrap">

    <div class="env2-coll-ledger__head">
      <div class="env2-coll-ledger__intro">
        {%- if env2_s.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="env2-eyebrow env2-coll-ledger__eyebrow">{{ env2_s.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h2 class="env2-h env2-coll-ledger__h2" id="env2-coll-ledger-h2">{{ env2_h2 }}</h2>
      </div>
      {%- if env2_deck != blank -%}
        <p class="env2-lead env2-coll-ledger__deck">{{ env2_deck }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <ol class="env2-coll-ledger__rows{% if env2_perbool %} env2-coll-ledger__rows--per{% endif %}">
      {%- for env2_num in env2_numlist -%}
        {%- assign env2_key = env2_num | replace: '.', '_' -%}
        <li class="env2-coll-ledger__row">
          {%- if env2_linkrows -%}
            <a class="env2-coll-ledger__k" href="#env2-coll-ruler" data-stop="{{ env2_key }}" aria-label="{{ env2_num }} {{ env2_unit_label | escape }} — {{ env2_s.link_label | default: 'לסרגל המידה' | escape }}">
              <bdi>{{ env2_num }}</bdi><small class="env2-coll-ledger__u">{{ env2_unit_label }}</small>
            </a>
          {%- else -%}
            <b class="env2-coll-ledger__k">
              <bdi>{{ env2_num }}</bdi><small class="env2-coll-ledger__u">{{ env2_unit_label }}</small>
            </b>
          {%- endif -%}
          <ul class="env2-coll-ledger__offers">
            {%- for env2_r in env2_sorted -%}
              {%- assign f = env2_r | split: FS -%}
              {%- if f[1] == env2_unit and f[2] == env2_num -%}
                <li class="env2-coll-ledger__o">
                  <span class="env2-coll-ledger__nm">
                    <a class="env2-coll-ledger__name" href="{{ f[5] }}">{{ f[4] | escape }}
                      {%- if f[6] != '' -%}
                        <span class="env2-coll-ledger__second"><bdi>{{ f[6] }}</bdi> {{ f[7] | escape }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </a>
                  </span>
                  <span class="env2-coll-ledger__price"><bdi>{{ f[8] }}</bdi> ₪</span>
                  {%- if env2_perbool -%}
                    {%- if f[9] != '' -%}
                      <span class="env2-coll-ledger__per"><bdi>≈{{ f[9] }}</bdi> {{ f[10] | escape }}</span>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <span class="env2-coll-ledger__per" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>

    {%- comment -%}
      THE FOOT — §4.5 non-negotiable 2. Every product that has no row is NAMED here, together with what
      it IS measured by, read off its own axis. Nothing is hidden and nothing is invented: the area
      product prints its own first and largest option values, a one-model product prints its single
      value, a product measured in another unit prints that unit's span, and a colour or model axis
      prints the axis's own name.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_clauses = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_shown = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_hidden = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_footmax = env2_s.foot_max | default: 6 -%}
    {%- assign env2_infolist2 = env2_infos | remove_first: RS | split: RS -%}
    {%- for env2_r in env2_infolist2 -%}
      {%- assign g = env2_r | split: FS -%}
      {%- unless g[0] == env2_unit and g[1] == '1' -%}
        {%- if env2_shown < env2_footmax -%}
          {%- assign env2_shown = env2_shown | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- comment -%}
            A measure that leads with a digit is isolated LTR and its unit word is left OUTSIDE the
            isolate. This is §6.12 measured, not assumed: a bdi with dir auto over "12x2 מ׳" takes its
            base direction from the first STRONG character, which is the Hebrew מ, so the whole token
            renders right-to-left and the page prints the rectangle backwards. A pure Hebrew value
            (צהוב חם) needs no isolate at all and gets none.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign env2_cl = '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_dig = '0123456789' -%}
          {%- assign env2_r6 = g[6] -%}
          {%- assign env2_h6 = env2_r6 | split: ' ' | first | default: '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_c6 = env2_h6 | slice: 0 | default: '' -%}
          {%- capture env2_bv -%}{%- if env2_c6 != '' and env2_dig contains env2_c6 -%}<bdi dir="ltr">{{ env2_h6 | escape }}</bdi>{{ env2_r6 | remove_first: env2_h6 | escape }}{%- else -%}{{ env2_r6 | escape }}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_r7 = g[7] -%}
          {%- assign env2_h7 = env2_r7 | split: ' ' | first | default: '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_c7 = env2_h7 | slice: 0 | default: '' -%}
          {%- capture env2_bmax -%}{%- if env2_c7 != '' and env2_dig contains env2_c7 -%}<bdi dir="ltr">{{ env2_h7 | escape }}</bdi>{{ env2_r7 | remove_first: env2_h7 | escape }}{%- else -%}{{ env2_r7 | escape }}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_r8 = g[8] -%}
          {%- assign env2_h8 = env2_r8 | split: ' ' | first | default: '' -%}
          {%- assign env2_c8 = env2_h8 | slice: 0 | default: '' -%}
          {%- capture env2_blast -%}{%- if env2_c8 != '' and env2_dig contains env2_c8 -%}<bdi dir="ltr">{{ env2_h8 | escape }}</bdi>{{ env2_r8 | remove_first: env2_h8 | escape }}{%- else -%}{{ env2_r8 | escape }}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- capture env2_bmin2 -%}<bdi dir="ltr">{{ g[9] | escape }}</bdi> {{ g[11] | escape }}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- capture env2_bmax2 -%}<bdi dir="ltr">{{ g[10] | escape }}</bdi> {{ g[11] | escape }}{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- if g[5] == 'Title' or g[6] == 'Default Title' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_none | default: '{name} — נמכרת בגרסה אחת' | escape -%}
          {%- elsif g[2] == '1' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_area | default: '{name} — לפי שטח, מ־{min} ועד {max}' | escape -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_cl | replace: '{min}', env2_bv | replace: '{max}', env2_bmax -%}
            {%- unless g[8] == g[7] -%}
              {%- assign env2_or = env2_s.foot_or | default: 'או {value}' | escape | replace: '{value}', env2_blast -%}
              {%- assign env2_cl = env2_cl | append: ' ' | append: env2_or -%}
            {%- endunless -%}
          {%- elsif g[3] == '1' and g[14] != '0' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_single | default: '{name} — דגם אחד: {value}' | escape | replace: '{value}', env2_bv -%}
          {%- elsif g[3] == '1' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_one | default: '{name} — {value}' | escape | replace: '{value}', env2_bv -%}
          {%- elsif g[1] == '1' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_other | default: '{name} — לפי {unit}: {min} עד {max}' | escape -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_cl | replace: '{unit}', g[12] | replace: '{min}', env2_bmin2 | replace: '{max}', env2_bmax2 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign env2_cl = env2_s.foot_plain | default: '{name} — לפי {axis}' | escape -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- assign env2_gname = g[4] | escape -%}
          {%- assign env2_gaxis = g[5] | escape -%}
          {%- assign env2_cl = env2_cl | replace: '{name}', env2_gname | replace: '{axis}', env2_gaxis -%}
          {%- assign env2_clauses = env2_clauses | append: '~~C~~' | append: env2_cl -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign env2_hidden = env2_hidden | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- assign env2_cllist = env2_clauses | remove_first: '~~C~~' | split: '~~C~~' -%}

    <div class="env2-coll-ledger__foot">
      {%- if env2_cllist.size > 0 -%}
        <p class="env2-coll-ledger__rest">
          {%- capture env2_boff -%}<bdi>{{ env2_offn }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign env2_lead = env2_s.foot_lead | default: '{n_word} הנותרות נמדדות אחרת:' | escape | replace: '{n_word}', env2_offword | replace: '{n}', env2_boff -%}
          {%- if env2_lead != blank -%}<span class="env2-coll-ledger__restlead">{{ env2_lead }}</span> {% endif -%}
          {%- for env2_cl in env2_cllist -%}{{ env2_cl }}{%- unless forloop.last -%}; {% endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}.
          {%- if env2_hidden > 0 -%}
            {%- capture env2_bhid -%}<bdi>{{ env2_hidden }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
            {%- assign env2_moretxt = env2_s.foot_more | default: 'ועוד {n} מנורות שנמדדות אחרת.' | escape | replace: '{n}', env2_bhid -%}
            {{ ' ' }}{{ env2_moretxt }}
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="env2-coll-ledger__notes">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
              <li class="env2-coll-ledger__note" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{{ block.settings.text }}</li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if env2_s.foot_note != blank -%}
        <p class="env2-coll-ledger__extra">{{ env2_s.foot_note }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- unless env2_s.show_page_note == false -%}
        <div class="env2-coll-ledger__page">
          {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-paginate', collection: env2_c, emit: 'note' %}
        </div>
      {%- endunless -%}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
.env2-coll-ledger{padding-block:clamp(72px,8vw,120px) clamp(56px,6vw,96px)}
.env2-coll-ledger__wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}
.env2-coll-ledger__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,3vw,54px);align-items:end;margin-block-end:clamp(26px,3.4vw,46px)}
.env2-coll-ledger__intro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.env2-coll-ledger__h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.2vw,60px);line-height:1}
.env2-coll-ledger__deck{max-width:44ch}
.env2-coll-ledger__deck bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-coll-ledger__rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-block-end:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-ledger__row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:clamp(84px,9vw,132px) minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:clamp(14px,2vw,32px);align-items:start;border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair);min-block-size:56px}
.env2-coll-ledger__k{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;min-block-size:44px;padding-block:12px 8px;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(32px,3vw,44px);line-height:1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;text-decoration:none}
.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__k{color:var(--env2-ink);transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__k:hover,.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__k:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ledger__u{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:max(.32em,13px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--env2-gold)}
.env2-coll-ledger__offers{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-block:8px 12px}
.env2-coll-ledger__o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"name price";column-gap:clamp(12px,1.8vw,30px);align-items:baseline;padding-block:1px}
.env2-coll-ledger__rows--per .env2-coll-ledger__o{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto clamp(118px,11vw,152px);grid-template-areas:"name price per"}
.env2-coll-ledger__nm{grid-area:name;display:block;min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-ledger__name{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0 .4em;min-block-size:44px;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-size:clamp(16px,1.3vw,19px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.3;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-decoration:none}
.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__name{color:var(--env2-ink);transition:color .3s}
.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__name:hover,.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__name:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow)}
.env2-coll-ledger__second{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:15px;color:var(--env2-ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-ledger__price::before{content:"— ";color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-ledger__price{grid-area:price;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:500;font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-glow);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;text-align:end}
.env2-coll-ledger__per{grid-area:per;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--env2-ink-2);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;text-align:end}
.env2-coll-ledger__foot{margin-block-start:clamp(22px,2.6vw,38px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.env2-coll-ledger__rest{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-width:76ch}
.env2-coll-ledger__restlead{color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-coll-ledger__notes{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.env2-coll-ledger__note{font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-ink-2);max-width:76ch}
.env2-coll-ledger__extra{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-mute);max-width:76ch}
.env2-coll-ledger__page{padding-block-start:6px}
.env2-coll-ledger__page .env2-coll-paginate__note{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-ledger__page .env2-coll-paginate__note bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
@media (max-width:899px){
  .env2-coll-ledger__head{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);align-items:start;gap:16px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__deck{max-width:52ch}
  .env2-coll-ledger__row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);row-gap:2px;padding-block:6px 4px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__k{padding-block:10px 2px;font-size:clamp(30px,8vw,38px)}
  .env2-coll-ledger__offers{padding-block:0 12px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__o{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"name price";row-gap:2px;padding-block:2px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__rows--per .env2-coll-ledger__o{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"name price" "per per"}
  .env2-coll-ledger__name{font-size:16px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__second{font-size:14px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__price{font-size:16px}
  .env2-coll-ledger__per{text-align:start;white-space:normal}
  .env2-coll-ledger__rest{font-size:14px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__k,.env2-coll-ledger .env2-coll-ledger__name{transition:none}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
/* elmsnest-v2-coll-ledger — the table is complete markup and loses nothing with this file deleted.
   All this does is turn each measure into the ruler's own stop: the anchor already points at
   #env2-coll-ruler, a real element that really scrolls with scripting off, and here it also checks
   that stop's radio and writes the ruler's #len-10 / #qty-4 hash so the narrowed page is shareable.
   Stop keys carry the '.' -> '_' transform, so 6.5 is 6_5 in the id, the label and the hash. */
(function () {
  function init(el) {
    if (el.__env2CollLedger) return;
    el.__env2CollLedger = true;
    var ruler = document.getElementById('env2-coll-ruler');
    var key = ruler ? (ruler.getAttribute('data-unit-key') || '') : '';
    el.querySelectorAll('.env2-coll-ledger__k[data-stop]').forEach(function (a) {
      var stop = a.getAttribute('data-stop') || '';
      var input = (ruler && /^[A-Za-z0-9_]+$/.test(stop)) ? ruler.querySelector('#env2-stop-' + stop) : null;
      if (!ruler) { a.removeAttribute('href'); return; }
      if (!input) return;
      a.addEventListener('click', function () {
        input.checked = true;
        if (!key || !window.history || !history.replaceState) return;
        /* the anchor's own navigation writes #env2-coll-ruler into the hash after every listener has
           run, so the ruler's shareable key is written on the next tick, not inside the handler. */
        setTimeout(function () {
          try { history.replaceState(null, '', '#' + key + '-' + stop); } catch (err) { /* opaque origin */ }
        }, 0);
      });
    });
    window.env2 ? env2.observe(el) : el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp]').forEach(function (l) { l.classList.add('lit'); });
  }
  function boot(root) {
    var scope = (root && root.querySelectorAll) ? root : document;
    scope.querySelectorAll('[data-env2-coll-ledger]').forEach(init);
    if (scope !== document && scope.matches && scope.matches('[data-env2-coll-ledger]')) init(scope);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { boot(document); });
  } else {
    boot(document);
  }
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { boot(e.target || document); });
})();
{% endjavascript %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "טבלת המידות",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "env2-coll-ledger-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enabled", "label": "להציג את הטבלה", "default": true,
      "info": "כבוי = הקטע לא מודפס כלל." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "show_on", "label": "באילו קולקציות",
      "options": [
        { "value": "auto", "label": "אוטומטי — רק כשרוב הקולקציה נמדדת" },
        { "value": "always", "label": "בכל קולקציה שיש בה שתי מידות" }
      ],
      "default": "auto",
      "info": "אוטומטי מדפיס את הטבלה רק כשיותר ממחצית המוצרים נמדדים באותה יחידה — גרילנדות במטרים ושבילים ביחידות. בתאורת קיר, בספוטים ובקטלוג אין יחידה משותפת והטבלה לא מודפסת." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "unit_mode", "label": "יחידת המדידה",
      "options": [
        { "value": "auto", "label": "אוטומטי — היחידה של רוב המוצרים" },
        { "value": "m", "label": "מטרים" },
        { "value": "qty", "label": "יחידות" },
        { "value": "led", "label": "נורות" },
        { "value": "w", "label": "ואט" },
        { "value": "k", "label": "קלווין" }
      ],
      "default": "auto" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "הפתיח" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "שורת פתיחה", "default": "אחרי המקום — המידה" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "כותרת — ציר של אורך", "default": "כמה מטר צריך?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading_alt", "label": "כותרת — ציר של כמות", "default": "כמה מנורות צריך?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "deck", "label": "המשפט — ציר של אורך",
      "default": "{n_word} מהגרילנדות נמכרות לפי אורך. אלה כל האורכים שיש בקולקציה, עם המחיר של כל אחד — לפני שבוחרים.",
      "info": "{n_word} מספר המוצרים הנמדדים במילים · {n} בספרות · {rows} מספר השורות · {count} מוצרים בקולקציה · {unit_word} שם היחידה." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "deck_alt", "label": "המשפט — ציר של כמות",
      "default": "{n_word} מהמנורות בקולקציה נמכרות לפי כמות. אלה כל הכמויות שיש, עם המחיר של כל אחת ועם המחיר ליחידה — לפני שבוחרים." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "השורות" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "link_rows", "label": "כל שורה מקשרת לסרגל", "default": true,
      "info": "המספר בכל שורה הופך לקישור אל סרגל המידה. עובד גם בלי JavaScript — הקישור גולל אל הסרגל." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "link_label", "label": "תיאור הקישור לקורא מסך", "default": "לסרגל המידה" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "short_titles", "label": "לקצר את שמות המוצרים", "default": true,
      "info": "חותך את שם המוצר במקף הראשון. כבוי = השם המלא." },
    { "type": "select", "id": "show_unit_price", "label": "להציג מחיר ליחידה",
      "options": [
        { "value": "auto", "label": "אוטומטי — רק בציר של כמות" },
        { "value": "always", "label": "תמיד" },
        { "value": "never", "label": "אף פעם" }
      ],
      "default": "auto" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "per_unit_word", "label": "המילה של המחיר ליחידה",
      "info": "ריק = «₪ למטר» בציר של אורך ו«₪ ליחידה» בציר של כמות. בשבילים אפשר «₪ לנקודת אור»." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "הערת השוליים" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "foot_lead", "label": "פתיחת ההערה", "default": "{n_word} הנותרות נמדדות אחרת:",
      "info": "{n_word} מספר המוצרים שאין להם שורה, במילים · {n} בספרות." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_area", "label": "נוסח למוצר הנמדד בשטח", "default": "{name} — לפי שטח, מ־{min} ועד {max}" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_or", "label": "תוספת למידה חלופית", "default": "או {value}" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_single", "label": "נוסח למוצר בדגם אחד", "default": "{name} — דגם אחד: {value}" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_one", "label": "נוסח למוצר באפשרות אחת", "default": "{name} — {value}" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_none", "label": "נוסח למוצר בלי ציר", "default": "{name} — נמכרת בגרסה אחת",
      "info": "מוצר שהציר היחיד שלו הוא «Title» של שופיפיי. אף פעם לא מצטטים את המילה הזאת בעמוד." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_other", "label": "נוסח למוצר הנמדד ביחידה אחרת", "default": "{name} — לפי {unit}: {min} עד {max}" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_plain", "label": "נוסח למוצר שאינו נמדד", "default": "{name} — לפי {axis}" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "foot_max", "label": "כמה מוצרים לנקוב בהערה", "min": 2, "max": 12, "step": 1, "default": 6 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_more", "label": "סיום כשיש עוד", "default": "ועוד {n} מנורות שנמדדות אחרת." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "foot_note", "label": "שורה חופשית בסוף" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_page_note", "label": "להציג את שורת העמוד האחד", "default": true }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 4,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "note",
      "name": "הערה",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "שורה נוספת מתחת להערת השוליים. המספרים בטבלה מחושבים מהמוצרים; ההערה הזאת היא המקום היחיד שאפשר לכתוב בו נתון שאינו נמצא בווריאציות." },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "הטקסט" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "טבלת המידות",
      "blocks": [ { "type": "note" } ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
